# flag and the flags that can't be changed. Smokegod (60) gives Decimus holylight, which isn't settable on players,
# then takes it away, and stats him after each. Stock set it, then couldn't clear it: do_flag kept a non-settable flag
# that was already set, but set one that wasn't (#70). Now a flag that isn't settable is refused, set or not ("That
# flag can't be changed."), and a settable one (comm brief) still changes.
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
flag char decimus plr +holylight
stat decimus
flag char decimus plr -holylight
stat decimus
flag char decimus comm +brief
stat decimus
flag char decimus comm -brief
stat decimus
